<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 480px; margin: auto; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px;">
  <h2 style="color: #d32f2f;">Reset your password</h2>
  <p>Hi <%= name %>,</p>
  <p>We received a request to reset your password. Use the OTP below to continue:</p>
  <div style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 6px; background: #f5f5f5; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 6px; text-align: center;">
    <%= otp %>
  </div>
  <p>This code expires in <%= expirationMinutes %> minutes.</p>
  <p style="color: #888; font-size: 12px;">If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email or contact support.</p>
</div>
